Oz: Ratmod's lag compensation (ratmod.github.io, rdntcntrl/ratoa_gamecode, GPL-2.0) on top of patch 0029's Unlagged,
fitted to Oz's game. Projectiles are delagged: a rocket, plasma ball, grenade or BFG shot starts at the shooter's
command time (less g_delagMissileBaseNudge, 10 ms), at most g_delagMissileMaxLatency (500) ms back, and its flight up
to the last server frame runs a frame at a time with the others where the shooter saw them (G_MissileRunDelag), then
at his next command (g_delagMissileImmediateRun 2). The shooter's cgame draws his own missile the moment he fires,
where the server has it, until the server's comes and takes over by launch time (cg_unlagged.c), and draws its
explosion at once (cg_predictExplosions), dropping the server's event for it; a wrong one is taken back. An exploded
missile stays a missile for its event (s.time2, origin2, otherEntityNum2) while every player's cgame knows that
(cg_ozDelagVersion in the userinfo), else it turns into an event entity as id's did. Others' missiles are drawn ahead
by cg_projectileNudge or the ping they came at (cg_projectileNudgeAuto). Teleporters with one destination tell the
clients where they go (G_SetTeleporterDestinations), and the cgame moves the player through them as he steps in
(cg_predictTeleport). The scoreboard shows the true ping (g_truePing). g_pingEqualizer 1 holds every player's
packets so all play at the highest ping (the engine's sv_ozEqDelays; a peer-to-peer host loses his zero ping),
g_lagLightning 1 gives the lightning gun 50 ms, g_allowTimenudge 0 turns cl_timeNudge and cg_cmdTimeNudge off,
g_delagAllowHitsAfterTele 0 keeps patch 0029's history reset at a teleport, cg_predictItemsNearPlayers 0 (the
default) predicts no pickup with someone else within 192 units, and cg_predictWeapons draws the weapon bar from the
prediction. The server tells the cgame its frame rate (g_svFps) and its missile speeds (g_ozMissileSpeeds, classic or
Quake Live's). Left out: Ratmod's optimized prediction (it only saves time, and Oz's prediction is its own), its
gametypes and everything else that isn't lag. Debug lines: g_delagMissileDebug 1 on the server, cg_debugDelag 1 in
the cgame.

